# Normalise text to LF in the repo and in every working copy, whatever
# the contributor's core.autocrlf. Prettier (endOfLine: lf) and rustfmt
# both expect LF; without this, Windows clones get CRLF on checkout and
# local `pnpm format:check` fails while CI passes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
